This repository has been deprecated.

The sandbox functionality has been merged into:
https://github.com/Hivemind-Edu/hivemind-claude-code-setup

See the `sandbox/` directory in that repository for the current implementation.

Migration PR: https://github.com/Hivemind-Edu/hivemind-claude-code-setup/pull/1

## Why was this deprecated?

The workspace-centric architecture consolidates 4 repositories into 3:

Before:
├── hivemind-claude-code-setup   (agents, commands, templates)
├── claude-code-sandbox          (Slack bot, Docker deployment)
├── hivemind-expo                (frontend)
└── hivemind-hono                (backend)

After:
├── hivemind-claude-code-setup
│   ├── .mcp.json                (declarative MCP config)
│   ├── .claude/                 (agents, commands)
│   ├── repos.json               (dynamic repo config)
│   └── sandbox/                 (merged bot code)
├── hivemind-expo
└── hivemind-hono

## Key improvements

1. Declarative MCP configuration via `.mcp.json` (Claude auto-discovery)
2. Dynamic repository configuration via `repos.json`
3. Unified CLAUDE.md at workspace root
4. Simpler Docker build (no git clone at build time)
5. Single source of truth for agents, commands, and templates

